  "identifier": "gow-sons-of-sparta-2026",
  "headline": "God of War Greek trilogy remake in development as 2D prequel Sons of Sparta launches on PS5",
  "description": "State of Play confirmed a God of War Greek trilogy remake is in development, while the surprise 2D action prequel God of War: Sons of Sparta launched on PS5. The new title follows young Kratos and Deimos and features spear-and-shield combat with Gifts of Olympus.",
  "articleBody": "Sony Santa Monica Studio confirmed during State of Play that a God of War Greek trilogy remake is in development, with original Kratos actor T.C. Carson returning for the project. The announcement ties into the franchise's 20th anniversary celebration and signals a renewed focus on the Greek era.\n\nAlongside the remake news, God of War: Sons of Sparta shadow-dropped on PS5. The 2D action platformer is a prequel set during Kratos' training in the Spartan agoge and follows his bond with his brother Deimos. Players fight with spear and shield while unleashing the Gifts of Olympus against enemies drawn from Greek myth.\n\nThe game is a collaboration between Santa Monica Studio and Mega Cat Studios. Standard and digital deluxe editions were announced at $29.99 and $39.99, respectively, setting the stage for more Greek-era projects to follow.",
